{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2025/12/30/i-had-not-previously-read.html","date":1767154334000,"content":"<p>I had not previously read Chenyang “Platy” Hsu’s blog, but their post <a href=\"https://hsu.cy/2025/12/times-new-american/\">Times New American: A Tale of Two Fonts</a> was delightful.</p>\n<img src=\"uploads/2025/times-new-american-a-tale-of-two-fonts.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Auto-generated description: Text discusses Times New Roman as a symbol of typographic apathy and a lack of creativity, likening it to a void.\" />","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"3ed249816e63946745f979ff509950870a2e4998e538a92488b19da697857b61","category":"Sites"}